# Cargo build artifacts
debug/
target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
**/mutants.out*/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# GitForgeOps state. The per-environment JSON manifests ARE committed —
# apply-on-merge.yml and rotate.yml push them back to main, and shared-mode
# ownership tracking is broken without them. Locks and the temp files
# StateFile::save renames from are local-only.
.state/*
!.state/*.json

# Environment files (may contain secrets)
.env
*.env.local

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS and editor artifacts. The Rust loader and .github/scripts/pr_input.py both
# skip these inside resources/ and overlays/ instead of failing the tree, but
# they should never reach a commit in the first place.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.orig
*.rej
